@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083/api

### Faturar planos Agenda
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoicing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-09-01",
  "end_date": "2026-09-30",
  "reprocess": false
}

### Consultar faturas (plan/invoicing/invoices)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan/invoicing/invoices?page=1&page_size=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar faturas com filtros (plan/invoicing/list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan/invoicing/list?page=1&page_size=10&nickname=joao&plan_type=1
Content-Type: application/json

